#    - `BarrierConfig.E_MAX_PITCH/ROLL/YAW`: Maximum allowable tracking error per axis
#    - `BarrierConfig.BARRIER_GAIN`: Strength of barrier enforcement
#    - `BarrierConfig.BARRIER_ALPHA`: Activation threshold (0.7-0.9)
#    - `BarrierConfig.ENABLE_ERROR_BARRIER`: Toggle error constraint enforcement
#    - `BarrierConfig.ENABLE_CONTROL_BARRIER`: Toggle reference governor
#
# ### 2. **Barrier Function Utilities** (Added before simulation loop)
#    - `logarithmic_barrier()`: Computes barrier value that grows as error → limit
#    - `barrier_derivative()`: Provides gradient for adaptive law modification
#    - `barrier_gradient_modifier()`: Modifies MRAC gradient to enforce constraints
#    - `constrain_reference()`: Reference governor for control feasibility
#
