# ## Resources for Deeper Understanding
#
# ### 📚 Essential Papers
#
# 1. **Hovakimyan & Cao (2010)** — *L1 Adaptive Control Theory*
#    - Chapter 2.3: Filter design
#    - Chapter 3: $\mathcal{L}_1$-norm condition derivation
#
# 2. **Cao & Hovakimyan (2008)** — *"Design and Analysis of a Novel L1 Adaptive Controller, Part I"*
#    - IEEE Trans. Automatic Control, Vol. 53, No. 3
#    - Formal proof of $\lambda^*$ optimality
#
# 3. **Gregory et al. (2009)** — *"L1 Adaptive Control for a UAV"*
#    - AIAA Guidance, Navigation, and Control Conference
#    - Practical implementation on quadrotor
#
# 4. **Jafarnejadsani et al. (2017)** — *"Optimized L1 Adaptive Controller for Trajectory Tracking"*
#    - Shows multi-input systems
#
# ### 🛠️ Implementation Tips
#
# - **Start conservative**: Use 0.6×λ* for initial flights
# - **Increase gradually**: +10% increments, check for oscillations
# - **Log everything**: Save (λ, error, control) data for offline analysis
# - **Use spectral analysis**: FFT of error signal reveals instability onset
#
